          "episode_type": "standard",
          "id": 7271634,
          "name": "Episode 1",
          "overview": "Successful lawyer Defne Derin, while carrying the burden of her family on her shoulders, is also struggling to keep the law firm she is a partner in afloat. However, an unexpected crisis leaves her facing one of the hardest decisions of her life. Left with no choice, Defne will ask for a loan from her school friend, the heir to Bartıner Holding. With this decision, Defne finds herself at an invitation she believes she doesn't belong to. That night, it will be the stage for encounters that will affect not only her career but also her heart. Defne, whose paths cross with charismatic architect Tolga Erez and powerful businessman Kadir Emindağ, unwittingly finds herself at the center of events that will completely change her life. A single step she takes will drag her to the beginning of a journey with no return.",
          "production_code": "",
          "runtime": 139,
          "season_number": 1,
          "show_id": 322499,
          "still_path": "/yitmOsolhQ2GWVoFDsvpCDv8VWs.jpg",
          "vote_average": 0,
          "vote_count": 0,
          "crew": [],
          "guest_stars": []
        },
        {
          "air_date": "2026-06-25",
          "episode_number": 2,
          "episode_type": "standard",
          "id": 7347726,
          "name": "Episode 2",
          "overview": "Defne begins to pay the price for the lie she told in a moment of panic. Now, she faces an almost impossible task before her: bringing together Kadir and Tolga, who can't even tolerate each other, on the same project. Defne, who follows Kadir all the way to his farm to convince him, encounters aspects of him she never knew. Meanwhile, Tolga is making the most of every opportunity to get closer to Defne. However, the real problem in Defne's life isn't love, but the debts piling up at her door and the law firm on the verge of falling apart. Just when she thinks everything is over, an unexpected development gives Defne hope once again. But the surprise that appears before her at the end of the night will turn not only her plans, but her heart, completely upside down.",
          "production_code": "",
          "runtime": 134,
          "season_number": 1,
          "show_id": 322499,
          "still_path": "/kBn0MRgizY06iY7qFsSHCjpXNFR.jpg",
          "vote_average": 0,
