        },
        {
          "air_date": "2026-07-02",
          "episode_number": 3,
          "episode_type": "standard",
          "id": 7347727,
          "name": "Episode 3",
          "overview": "Upon learning that Kadir has decided against divorce, Defne experiences profound disappointment and resolves to keep her distance from him. However, due to the massive project at Bartıner Holding, Defne, Kadir, and Tolga are forced to meet at the same table. As the enmity between Kadir and Tolga puts everything at risk, Levent assigns Defne the task of uncovering the truth behind this hostility. Meanwhile, an unexpected closeness that Defne will experience while trying to unravel the two men's past will once again upend everyone's balance.",
          "production_code": "",
          "runtime": 147,
          "season_number": 1,
          "show_id": 322499,
          "still_path": "/2OOdlwzR1fyHdEplCwb55TozPyw.jpg",
          "vote_average": 0,
          "vote_count": 0,
          "crew": [],
          "guest_stars": []
        },
        {
          "air_date": "2026-07-09",
          "episode_number": 4,
          "episode_type": "standard",
          "id": 7481218,
          "name": "Episode 4",
          "overview": "Following Tolga's surprise proposal, Defne is forced to make a difficult choice between her heart and her mind. Kadir's unexpected move, succumbing to his jealousy, takes the tension between the two to an entirely different level, while Defne sets out to uncover the long-hidden secret between Kadir and Tolga. As balances shift rapidly at Bartıner Holding, truths from the past slowly begin to surface. Defne's decision and the new clues that emerge will once again reveal that nothing is as it seems, and she will learn the reason behind the enmity between Defne, Kadir, and Tolga.",
          "production_code": "",
          "runtime": 141,
          "season_number": 1,
