        {
          "air_date": "2026-07-16",
          "episode_number": 5,
          "episode_type": "standard",
          "id": 7528100,
          "name": "Episode 5",
          "overview": "The great secret spilling over from Kadir's past deeply shakes not only the Emindağ family but also the budding love between Defne and Kadir. Defne, caught between her conscience and her heart, reaches the threshold of a point of no return, while Tolga presses the button for a surprising new move that will shock everyone. Where love, secrets, and reckonings intertwine, the surprising developments will make it clear that nothing will ever be the same again.",
          "production_code": "",
