        {
          "air_date": "2026-07-23",
          "episode_number": 6,
          "episode_type": "standard",
          "id": 7572645,
          "name": "Episode 6",
          "overview": "As Kadir draws closer to the truth with each passing day, Defne prepares to pay the heaviest price to protect the man she loves. Tolga's unexpected move upends all the established balances, while the partnership he forms with Leyla begins to threaten Defne and Kadir's happiness. Caught between her heart and her conscience, Defne reaches the brink of an irreversible decision, as a series of rapid developments drags everyone down an entirely different path. In this episode, where she faces love's greatest test, a single sentence spoken will change Defne and Kadir's story in an irrevocable way.",
          "production_code": "",
          "runtime": 141,
