        {
          "air_date": "2026-07-30",
          "episode_number": 7,
          "episode_type": "standard",
          "id": 7607555,
          "name": "Episode 7",
          "overview": "Defne, to forget Kadir, decides to leave Istanbul, while fate once again puts the two on the same path. The unexpected journey they embark on together brings their suppressed feelings back to the surface, while a new name entering between them causes Defne to confront an unexpected jealousy she never anticipated. Meanwhile, critical decisions at the company change all the balances, and Selma and Leyla's moves once again drive Defne and Kadir's love into a dead end. Where love, pride, and jealousy intertwine, the surprise developments will bring Defne and Kadir to the threshold of a confrontation they never expected.",
          "production_code": "",
