          "episode_number": 8,
          "episode_type": "standard",
          "id": 7658464,
          "name": "Episode 8",
          "overview": "Tolga discovers a shocking truth about a situation that affected his past, and the revelation causes him to lose trust in one of the most important people in his life. Attempts to make things right fail to ease the tension, and their relationship reaches a critical point.\n\nMeanwhile, Kadir and Defne go through a difficult period. An unfortunate coincidence leads to suspicion and misunderstandings, while the growing closeness between them is overshadowed by mistrust. At the professional level, rivalries within Bartıner Holding intensify, as hidden strategies begin to shift the balance of power.\n\nIn the end, overwhelmed by everything that has happened, Defne becomes involved in a serious accident. Her fate remains uncertain, and this dramatic turn of events is set to have major consequences for all the characters.",
